Root cause:
The bug was caused by the incorrect handling of mouse transparency during the transition between views. Specifically, the previous implementation set the mouse transparency of the previous node instead of the entire view, which led to unintended interactions with the user interface elements during the transition. The patch corrects this by setting the mouse transparency of the whole view to true when transitioning, ensuring that no mouse events are processed for the previous node, thus preventing any interaction issues.
